eck; fail → AOB-PR-1002-V02-S004, pass → AOB-PR-1002-V02-S005.","Data Involved":"Process attributes + evidence refs","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Pass/Fail decision","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S004","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":40,"Process Step":"Request clarification (fail path) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Return to requestor with reason codes; loop to AOB-PR-1002-V02-S003.","Data Involved":"Missing field list","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Updated Ticket","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S005","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":50,"Process Step":"Business approval - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Business approver confirms request is valid and authorised.","Data Involved":"Key Process attributes","Source BDEs":"Routed Ticket","Target BDEs":"Approved/Rejected","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S006","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":60,"Process Step":"Approval event gateway - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Wait for approve/reject/withdraw/timeout; timeout → escalation.","Data Involved":"Approval status","Source BDEs":"Approval Task","Target BDEs":"Outcome event","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S007","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":70,"Process Step":"Create onboarding draft - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Maker maps request to draft, creates v1 + change log.","Data Involved":"Process attributes","Source BDEs":"Approved Ticket","Target BDEs":"Draft Record v1","Data Transformed":"Standardisation + typing","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Ste