record","Source BDEs":"Landing Record","Target BDEs":"DQ Results","Data Transformed":"Flags/scores calculated","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S013","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":130,"Process Step":"Reference enrichment - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Standardize country/currency/team codes.","Data Involved":"Landing record","Source BDEs":"Landing Record","Target BDEs":"Enriched Record","Data Transformed":"Lookup + normalisation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S014","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":140,"Process Step":"Duplicate detect &amp; merge decision - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Detect duplicates; merge/reject/proceed decision.","Data Involved":"Identity fields","Source BDEs":"Enriched Record","Target BDEs":"Merge Outcome","Data Transformed":"Fuzzy match + survivorship","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S015","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":150,"Process Step":"Validation join - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Consolidate parallel outputs into Validated Draft.","Data Involved":"DQ + enriched + merge","Source BDEs":"DQ/Enriched/Merge Results","Target BDEs":"Validated Draft","Data Transformed":"Consolidation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S016","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":160,"Process Step":"Conditional SPECIALIST checks - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Determine if Process SPECIALIST review is required based on explicit Tax Review Basis derived from Process Status and Process Type.","Data Involved":"Tax review routing data","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Specialist Review Flag","Data Transformed":"Rule evaluation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S017","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":170,"Process Step":"Process SPECIALIST review (conditional) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"SPECIALIST reviews tax-triggered cases.","Data Involved":"Tax review routing data","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Tax Approved / Correction Required","Data Transformed":"Possible corrections","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S018","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":180,"Process Step":"DQ pass gateway - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Evaluate DQ + Merge + Specialist outcomes; fail → AOB-PR-1002-V02-S019, pass → AOB-PR-1002-V02-S020.","Data Involved":"DQ + merge + specialist outcomes","Source BDEs":"Validated Draft","Target BDEs":"Pass/Fail decision","Data Transformed":"None","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S019","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":190,"Process Step":"Remediation loop - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Maker corrects and resubmits; max 3 attempts; loop to AOB-PR-1002-V02-S011.","Data Involved":"Failed fields","Source BDEs":"Fail reasons + draft","Target BDEs":"Corrected Draft / Parked","Data Transformed":"Data corrections","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S020","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":200,"Process Step":"Maker-checker (4-eye) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Checker reviews, approves/rejects with reasons; logged for audit.","Data Involved":"Approved candidate","Source BDEs":"Validated/Corrected Draft","Target BDEs":"Checker Outcome","Data Transformed":"Controlled edits + audit","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S021","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":210,"Process Step":"Publish to onboarding master - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Publish to Azure Data Lake master; stamp lineage/audit.","Data Involved":"Approved record","Source BDEs":"Checker Approved Draft","Target BDEs":"Onboarding Master Record","Data Transformed":"Audit stamping","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S022","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":220,"Process Step":"Write controls &amp; DQ metrics - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Persist DQ results, approvals, remediation history to controls dataset.","Data Involved":"Control metrics","Source BDEs":"DQ/Workflow outputs","Target BDEs":"Controls &amp; DQ Record","Data Transformed":"Aggregation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S023","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":230,"Process Step":"Distribute to Downstream Systems (transaction) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Parallel fan-out; record per-consumer status; allow replay.","Data Involved":"Published record","Source BDEs":"Onboarding Master Record","Target BDEs":"Consumer payloads + statuses","Data Transformed":"Consumer mapping","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S024","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":240,"Process Step":"Publish to DDT (alias: External Consumer A (Market Data) or Downstream Consumer A) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Produce DDT-specific extract and deliver.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"DDT delivery","Data Transformed":"Schema mapping","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S025","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":250,"Process Step":"Publish to Portfolio Analytics Platform (ANALYTICS CONSUMER B (HACKATHON) OR AZURE SYNAPSE/DATABRICKS ANALYTICS WORKSPACE) (alias: Analytics Platform) - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Deliver via API MANAGEMENT + AZURE FUNCTIONS (OR API INTEGRATION LAYER (AZURE API MANAGEMENT)) to Analytics Consumer B with retries and idempotency using Tracking ID.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"Analytics delivery","Data Transformed":"Schema mapping","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S026","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":260,"Process Step":"Publish to Client Reporting Hub topic - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Publish event/message to Reporting Consumer C (Hackathon) or Downstream Reporting Hub (Consumer C) via Azure Service Bus Topic.","Data Involved":"Consumer payload","Source BDEs":"Consumer payload","Target BDEs":"CRH message","Data Transformed":"Event translation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S027","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":270,"Process Step":"Record publication events - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Append delivery events for audit/replay/monitoring.","Data Involved":"Event data","Source BDEs":"Delivery outcomes","Target BDEs":"Publication Events","Data Transformed":"Event normalisation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S028","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":280,"Process Step":"Update DQ dashboard - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Refresh dashboard with status + DQ metrics.","Data Involved":"Metrics","Source BDEs":"Controls &amp; DQ Record","Target BDEs":"Dashboard view","Data Transformed":"Aggregation","L4 Process Name":"SME Account Opening - Express"},{"Process Step ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02-S029","Process ID":"AOB-PR-1002-V02","Reorder":290,"Process Step":"Notify completion - SME Account Opening - Express","Process Step Description":"Notify requestor/stakeholders with outcome + Tracking ID.","Data In